{
  "title": "Oily Savory Malaysian Beef Satay",
  "description": "A classic Malaysian dish featuring grilled beef skewers served with a side of spicy peanut sauce, this recipe is kosher-friendly and cooked to perfection on a hot stone plate.",
  "cuisine": "Malaysian",
